/span><span style='background-color: initial;'>practicidad en movimiento con esta funda de neopreno<\/span><\/p><h2>Compatibilidades:<\/h2><p><ul><li>APPLE 16 pulgadas MacBook Pro\/MAX 2021 (Modelo A2485) M1 | 16 pulgadas MacBook Pro 2019 (Modelo A2141) | 15 pulgadas antiguo MacBook&nbsp;<span style='background-color: initial;'>Pro con Pantalla Retina 2012-2015 (Modelo A1398)<\/span><\/li><li>MICROSOFT 15 pulgadas Microsoft Surface Book 3\/2 | 15 Pulgadas Surface Book 2\/XPS | Surface Laptop 3 15<\/li><li>ACER 15,6' Aspire 3 | 15,6' Aspire 5 | 15,6' Aspire 7 | 15,6' Chromebook | 15,6' Spin | 15,6' Swift 3 | 15,6' Nitro 5\/7 | Swift 5 SF515 | Aspire 1 A114 |&nbsp;<span style='background-color: initial;'>ES1 | V15 | E15 | F15 | ES 15<\/span><\/li><li>ASUS 15,6' TUF | 15,6' TUF Gaming FX506 | TUF Gaming Dash F15 FX516 | ROG Zephyrus M15 GU502 | VivoBook S15 S530 | F55UA | X550ZA |&nbsp;<span style='background-color: initial;'>X555LA | X555YA | K501LX | K501UX | Zenbook Pro | Zenbook | Q503 | Q504UA<\/span><\/li><li>LENOVO 15,6' Legion 5 | 15,6' IdeaPad | 15,6' ThinkPad | 15,6' Chromebook | 15,6' V15\/V155\/V130 | 15,6' Y740\/Y540\/Y530 | 15,6' Ultrabook |&nbsp;<span style='background-color: initial;'>15,6' Notebook | IdeaPad 3 | IdeaPad Gaming 3 | V15-ADA | Chromebook C340 (15&#8221;) | IdeaPad 300 Series S340 (15') | IdeaPad 500 Series S540 (15&#8221;)&nbsp;<\/span><span style='background-color: initial;'>| L560 | E570 | E560 | Yoga 710 | IdeaPad 110\/310\/510\/700 | Flex<\/span><\/li><li>HUAWEI MateBook D 16 2021<\/li><li>HP 250 G7 | Pavilion 16 | Pavilion Gaming 16 | 15,6' Spectre x360 | 15,6' EliteBook | 15,6' Probook | ENVY x360 Laptop - 15t touch | Pavilion x360 |&nbsp;<span style='background-color: initial;'>15Z\/15T | ZBook 15 | OMEN Notebook | HP Probook 440 | 650 G4<\/span><\/li><li>DELL 15,6' Vostro 15 3000 9000 | Inspiron 15 3000\/5000\/7000 | Latitude 3000 | Precision 7520\/7530 | New latitude 15 5000<\/li><li>Samsung Notebook 9 \/ 15.6 pulgadas Samsung No